R=Path(__file__).parent; OUT=R/'outputs'/'2026-10-16'/'anime-vanguards-15-new-features'; IMG=R/'source-15-keyart.jpg'; SRC='https://vanguards.gg/changelog'; slug='anime-vanguards-15-new-features'
langs={
'en':dict(lang='English',title='Anime Vanguards 15.0 New Features and Gameplay Guide',intro='Version 15.0 is built around new ways to play. True Shadow Monarch adds a progression system, Shadow Army gives you custom Shadows, and Memoria Maker changes how builds are tested. New raids, dungeons, trials, card battles and a six-world campaign give you several routes after the update.',heads=['What changed','How to play the new systems','Use UGphone for long routines','First session checklist','SEO metadata','Join our Discord'],features=['True Shadow Monarch is a Transcendent evolution from Song Jinwu and Igros through the Player Quest. Put it in the first slot to open the Monarch slot and a custom team bar. Takedowns grant System EXP, System Gold and stat points. Levels unlock Shadow slots at 1, 10, 25, 40, 60 and 80, with the cap at 100.','Shadow Army lets you equip up to six Shadows. Normal Shadows level from takedowns and unlock passive choices. When you own a boss unit, defeat its boss form and use Arise to recruit a custom Shadow with a random Shadow Passive.','Memoria Maker fuses one Secret or Vanguard memoria with two donors. The base keeps its first passive, while donor passives replace the second and third at 50% and 30% strength. Test the recipe in Unit Sandbox first because each fusion consumes both donors and one Memoria Puzzle Piece.','Fourteen Vanguard Familiars add unit-specific effects. Returned Dungeon tokens and The First Commander tokens buy different familiar groups, so choose your farming route around the unit you want to improve.'],play=['Returned Dungeon is a 20-wave, two-lane raid. Awaken statues before wave 15: each adds stronger enemies and 20% more rewards. The last statue decides the wave 20 boss, while all five summon The Designer.','The First Commander is a command-focused dungeon. Your units deal half damage, while your army uses troop perks. Plan the troop mix before the waves rather than changing it after the fight starts.','Shadow Trials lets you control the Monarch in real-time arena battles against Shadows. It has seven trials and supports solo play or up to four players.','Card Battle uses a 20-card deck built around a captain. Start with bots to learn the three-hitpoint and energy rules, then refine the deck for duels.','Apostles Vs Vanguards is a six-world campaign. Other additions include Pirate Dynasty Arena Capture the Flag, new solo Battle Towers, reworked Elemental Towers and AV Arcade mini-games. The rebuilt lobby also adds Quick Actions, teleport Areas, a searchable Codex and a new Profile. Auto Summon can target a unit or memoria and continue until the target appears, currency runs out or you stop it.'],ug=['Anime Vanguards supports UGphone cloud automation and multiple accounts. Configure a repeatable route for eligible stages, Returned Dungeon attempts or daily checks while UGphone performs the routine actions in the cloud.','Use separate cloud instances for different accounts or goals. This is useful for comparing teams, collecting login rewards and checking Event Pass or quest progress remotely. Review the run when you need to change a target, team or route.'],check=['Equip True Shadow Monarch and earn early System levels from takedowns.','Test one Shadow Army lineup and one Memoria Maker recipe in Unit Sandbox.','Choose a single farming route, then use Quick Actions and the Codex to move between stages and shops.'],cta='Start with one system, learn its resource loop, then expand into the modes that match your team.'),
'id':dict(lang='Bahasa Indonesia',title='Panduan Fitur Baru dan Gameplay Anime Vanguards 15.0',intro='Versi 15.0 menghadirkan cara bermain baru. True Shadow Monarch punya sistem progresi sendiri, Shadow Army memberi Shadow kustom, dan Memoria Maker mengubah cara menguji build. Raid, dungeon, trial, duel kartu, dan campaign enam dunia menambah banyak rute setelah update.',heads=['Perubahan utama','Cara memainkan sistem baru','Gunakan UGphone untuk rutinitas panjang','Checklist sesi pertama','Metadata SEO','Gabung Discord kami'],features=['True Shadow Monarch adalah evolusi Transcendent dari Song Jinwu dan Igros melalui Player Quest. Pasang di slot pertama untuk membuka slot Monarch dan team bar khusus. Takedown memberi System EXP, System Gold, dan stat points. Level membuka Shadow slot di level 1, 10, 25, 40, 60, dan 80; batasnya 100.','Shadow Army memungkinkan hingga enam Shadow. Shadow biasa naik level dari takedown dan membuka pilihan pasif. Jika kamu memiliki unit boss, kalahkan versi boss-nya lalu gunakan Arise untuk merekrut Shadow kustom dengan Shadow Passive acak.','Memoria Maker menggabungkan satu memoria Secret atau Vanguard dengan dua donor. Base mempertahankan pasif pertama; pasif donor menggantikan pasif kedua dan ketiga pada kekuatan 50% dan 30%. Uji resep di Unit Sandbox karena fusi menghabiskan dua donor dan satu Memoria Puzzle Piece.','Empat belas Vanguard Familiar memberi efek khusus unit. Token Returned Dungeon dan The First Commander membeli kelompok familiar berbeda, jadi pilih rute farming sesuai unit yang ingin kamu tingkatkan.'],play=['Returned Dungeon adalah raid 20 wave dengan dua lane. Bangunkan statue sebelum wave 15: musuh berikutnya lebih kuat, tetapi hadiah bertambah 20%. Statue terakhir menentukan boss wave 20; jika semua lima aktif, The Designer muncul.','The First Commander adalah dungeon berbasis komando. Unit kamu memberi setengah damage, sedangkan pasukan memakai perk troop. Susun komposisi sebelum wave dimulai.','Shadow Trials membuatmu mengendalikan Monarch dalam arena real-time melawan Shadow. Ada tujuh trial dan bisa dimainkan solo atau hingga empat pemain.','Card Battle memakai deck 20 kartu dengan captain. Mulai dari bot untuk memahami aturan tiga hit point dan energy, lalu perbaiki deck untuk duel.','Apostles Vs Vanguards adalah campaign enam dunia. Ada juga Pirate Dynasty Arena Capture the Flag, Battle Towers solo, Elemental Towers yang dirombak, dan mini-game AV Arcade. Lobby baru punya Quick Actions, teleport Areas, Codex dengan pencarian, dan Profile baru. Auto Summon dapat menargetkan unit atau memoria sampai target didapat, currency habis, atau kamu menghentikannya.'],ug=['Anime Vanguards mendukung otomatisasi cloud UGphone dan beberapa akun. Atur rute stage berulang, percobaan Returned Dungeon, atau pengecekan harian agar UGphone menjalankan tindakan rutin di cloud.','Gunakan instance cloud terpisah untuk akun atau target berbeda. Ini membantu membandingkan tim, mengambil hadiah login, dan memantau Event Pass atau quest dari jarak jauh.'],check=['Pasang True Shadow Monarch dan naikkan System dari takedown.','Uji satu susunan Shadow Army dan satu resep Memoria Maker di Unit Sandbox.','Pilih satu rute farming, lalu gunakan Quick Actions dan Codex untuk berpindah stage dan shop.'],cta='Mulai dari satu sistem, pahami alur resource-nya, lalu lanjutkan ke mode yang cocok dengan timmu.'),
'pt':dict(lang='Português',title='Guia de Novos Recursos e Gameplay de Anime Vanguards 15.0',intro='A versão 15.0 traz novas formas de jogar. True Shadow Monarch ganhou um sistema de progressão, Shadow Army permite criar Shadows personalizados e Memoria Maker muda os testes de builds. Raids, dungeons, trials, cartas e uma campanha de seis mundos ampliam as opções.',heads=['O que mudou','Como jogar os novos sistemas','Use o UGphone em rotinas longas','Checklist da primeira sessão','Metadados SEO','Entre no nosso Discord'],features=['True Shadow Monarch é uma evolução Transcendent de Song Jinwu e Igros pela Player Quest. Coloque-o no primeiro slot para abrir o slot do Monarch e uma barra de equipe própria. Takedowns dão System EXP, System Gold e pontos de atributo. Os slots de Shadow são liberados nos níveis 1, 10, 25, 40, 60 e 80; o limite é 100.','Shadow Army permite equipar até seis Shadows. Eles sobem de nível com takedowns e liberam passivas. Se você possui a unidade de um boss, derrote a versão boss e use Arise para recrutar um Shadow personalizado com uma Shadow Passive aleatória.','Memoria Maker funde uma memoria Secret ou Vanguard com duas doadoras. A base mantém a primeira passiva; as doadoras substituem a segunda e a terceira com 50% e 30% de força. Teste no Unit Sandbox, pois cada fusão consome as duas doadoras e uma Memoria Puzzle Piece.','Quatorze Vanguard Familiars adicionam efeitos por unidade. Tokens de Returned Dungeon e The First Commander compram grupos diferentes, então escolha a rota conforme a unidade que deseja melhorar.'],play=['Returned Dungeon é uma raid de 20 waves em duas lanes. Desperte estátuas antes da wave 15: os inimigos ficam mais fortes, mas as recompensas aumentam 20%. A última estátua define o boss da wave 20; as cinco invocam The Designer.','The First Commander é uma dungeon de comando. Suas unidades causam metade do dano, enquanto as tropas usam perks. Monte a composição antes das waves.','Shadow Trials permite controlar o Monarch em arenas em tempo real contra Shadows. São sete trials, solo ou com até quatro jogadores.','Card Battle usa um deck de 20 cartas em torno de um captain. Comece contra bots para aprender as regras de três pontos de vida e energy.','Apostles Vs Vanguards é uma campanha de seis mundos. Também há Pirate Dynasty Arena Capture the Flag, Battle Towers solo, Elemental Towers reformuladas e mini-jogos AV Arcade. O lobby recebeu Quick Actions, Areas de teleporte, Codex com busca e Profile novo. Auto Summon pode buscar uma unidade ou memoria até obtê-la, acabar a moeda ou ser interrompido.'],ug=['Anime Vanguards permite automação na nuvem do UGphone e várias contas. Configure rotas repetíveis, tentativas de Returned Dungeon ou verificações diárias para o UGphone executar as ações rotineiras na nuvem.','Use instâncias separadas para contas e metas diferentes. Assim fica mais fácil comparar equipes, resgatar login e acompanhar Event Pass ou quests remotamente.'],check=['Equipe True Shadow Monarch e ganhe níveis de System com takedowns.','Teste uma formação de Shadow Army e uma receita no Memoria Maker pelo Unit Sandbox.','Escolha uma rota de farm e use Quick Actions e o Codex para acessar fases e lojas.'],cta='Comece por um sistema, entenda seus recursos e depois avance para os modos adequados à sua equipe.'),
}
